+/**
+ * apply_swap_policy() - Clamp the reported swap total the same way in every
+ * caller.
+ * @unified:	Whether the host uses the unified (v2) cgroup hierarchy.
+ * @memlimit_kb:	The memory (RAM) limit the caller is reporting, in kB.
+ * @swtotal:	The unclamped swap total, in kB.
+ * @swusage:	The swap usage, in kB.
